WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:04,210
I'm so sorry, my house even has walls

2
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:07,210
They are all made of 20 centimeters of diamond material.

3
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,560
Questions you can all think of

4
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,560
Could I have imagined it at the beginning?

5
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,560
Cannonballs can't break it

6
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:16,560
I'm afraid of you broken hammers and axes

7
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:25,750
How could this happen?

8
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:28,820
Why would anyone build a house like this?

9
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:31,140
When I first learned about their home decoration

10
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:37,440
But I never dreamed that I would be able to cultivate like this Zhang Yi

11
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:39,440
He already knew there would be a snowstorm

12
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:42,440
Everything he did was to protect us
